{"sections":[{"slug":"纤维函子","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"纤维函子"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">纤维函子</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"纤维函子"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">观念</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">纤维函子指的是某种空间</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的层范畴</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">作为几何对象的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/代数-几何对偶","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">代数侧对偶</span>"}},{"Plain":") <span lang=\"zh\">到点上的层范畴的函子</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">在</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/代数-几何对偶","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">代数</span>–<span lang=\"zh\">几何对偶</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">下对应空间</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">的一个</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">点</span></strong>.</p>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/意象","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">意象</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/茎","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">茎</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">是最常见的纤维函子</span>.</p>\n"}]}}}]}